../2601.08530/README.md:341:| G5 shipping difficulty | at shipping `n=256`, 0/200,000 uniformly sampled complete permutations verified; the exact subset DP examined 50,000 subset states and hit its cap without a witness in 0.08911326713860035 seconds |
